      "Verify all input fields against the pinned projection and 38-slot mapping.",
      "Map every accepted source_field to its opaque allowlisted_source_slot; missing or duplicate mapping rejects.",
      "Apply only schema-declared type, enum, ordering, and canonicalization rules.",
      "Preserve explicit public values; do not infer, impute, or reconstruct values from hidden or realized state.",
      "Emit a structural projection envelope for the existing M0 compiler boundary only."
    ],
